<script is:inline>
    window.animalNames = ["Chicken","Toucan","Hummingbird","Eagle","Penguin","Owl"];
    window.animalsText = ["The Free Range Chicken is our personal symbol of a distinct kind of freedom—a curiosity and willingness to wander that reveal the most powerful stories. Click above to see more of our feathered friends, and find out how they inspire us every day.","The majestic Toucan is a symbol of travel and communication—the transportation of meaning and message from one place to another. It reminds us to explore, and be receptive to apparently atypical perspectives.","Speed and joy are the hallmarks of the Hummingbird, whose vibrant color and quick, darting movements inspire us to think in clever new ways, and seek out the extraordinary.","To Americans, the mighty Eagle signifies liberty. Ancient Rome upheld it as a sign of power and victory. Throughout history, this bird has symbolized the courage to break bonds, overcome adversity, and feast on the fullness of life. ","Like the Penguin, at home on land or in the sea, we live in two worlds—the solid, waking world of the everyday and the deep ocean of the unconscious, where dreams live and stories are born.","The wise Owl brings magic and ancient knowledge out of the dark and into the moonlight. It represents our comfort in the strange, quiet places where mystery waits."];
</script>

