                </div>
            
                
                <div class="services-slider-item slide">
                    <div class="description">
                        <p>Good design enriches our world, improves our lives, and makes easy communication possible. We rely on robust design thinking to help us create beautiful work, support meaningful causes, and spread inspiring media.</p>
                        <a class="hs-button" href="/services#design">Learn More</a>
                    </div>
                    <img src="/hubfs/Free-Range/Lithium-B3D.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="services-slider-item slide">
                    <div class="description">
                        <p>Our one-of-a-kind workshops teach you how to find the story that powers your brand, and tell it in a way that draws people to your cause. By rooting your brand in archetype and story structure, you will learn how to understand its past, direct its present—and bring about its remarkable future.&nbsp;</p>
